WEBVTT

00:28:28.675 --> 00:28:33.263
and I caught the bug
that so many people since have caught.

00:28:33.707 --> 00:28:37.178
And he eventually called himself
a computer widow,

00:28:37.202 --> 00:28:39.671
because I liked the computer
more than him.

00:28:39.695 --> 00:28:40.695
AG: (Laughs)

00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:43.997
LW: I mean, I was just amazed
at what it could do.

00:28:44.021 --> 00:28:46.162
AG: What it could do was draw.

00:28:46.186 --> 00:28:49.315
So Lynda got her own Macintosh
and brought it into work.

00:28:49.339 --> 00:28:51.922
People started asking her
to do projects for them.

00:28:51.946 --> 00:28:54.637
LW: Somehow they thought
I knew more than they did,

00:28:54.661 --> 00:28:55.922
which was, you know,

00:28:55.946 --> 00:28:59.680
basically I'd had five minutes longer
with something than they had.